{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-12-2:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_12_2\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [],\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"block:v2_n_12_2:heading\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"数据采集与方式\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"source_window:814–816\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"block:v2_n_12_2:p1\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"本试验采用电子数据采集（EDC/eCRF）系统进行数据采集。数据由研究者或授权人员录入；必要时使用纸质源文件。不良事件和合并用药采用标准词典编码。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"source_window:814–816\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"block:v2_n_12_2:p2\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"数据来源通过源数据识别计划/源数据映射表定义每个变量的来源，类别包括直接录入eCRF、从源文件转录、由外部供应商传输（如中心实验室）。所有源数据需可溯源、清晰、同步、原始、准确、完整、一致、持久、可获取（ALCOA+）。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"source_window:814–816\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"block:v2_n_12_2:p3\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"直接以eCRF作为源数据的情形，如受试者自评量表或研究者直接录入的评估，需在源数据识别计划中预先规定，并确保符合ALCOA+原则。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"source_window:814–816\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"block:v2_n_12_2:p4\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"从源文件转录至eCRF的数据，如实验室检查、心电图等，转录数据需经源数据核查，确保与源文件一致；更正保留稽查轨迹。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"source_window:814–816\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"block:v2_n_12_2:p5\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"监查员按监查计划进行源数据核查，比较源文件与eCRF；发现差异时发起质疑并跟踪至解决。源数据核查活动记录在监查报告中。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"source_window:814–816\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"block:v2_n_12_2:table1\",\n      \"kind\": \"table\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"table\": {\n        \"table_id\": \"table:v2_n_12_2:data_capture\",\n        \"block_id\": \"block:v2_